# The topic-tags table's name, which a rebuild reports when it discards it (docs/standards/architecture.md rule 9; #225).
owner: packages/index/src/schema.ts
claim: the course file's topic tags live in a table named topics, the name a rebuild's DiscardedTable carries
cite: packages/index/src/schema.ts
# The quoted name is swept as a table field or enum member, never bare: bare, it also matched CourseReader's
# topics method in a key union or Pick<>, which cost a verify run to #428 and #534.
sweep: packages/index/src/schema\.ts|create table topics\b|table: 'topics'|enum\(\['topics'|\btopics: \[|\.claude/ledgers/topics-table\.ledger
